    "description": "### Impact\r\n\r\nAn attacker who knows a deactivated account’s password could bypass configured two factor authentication and gain access to that account. Administrator accounts are affected, so successful exploitation could compromise the site.\r\n\r\n### Patches\r\n\r\nThis issue is patched in the latest version of Discourse.\r\n\r\n### Workarounds\r\n\r\nNone.",
